{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24616","headline":"李留守相公见过池上泛舟举酒话及翰林旧事因成四韵以献之 · 白居易","name":"李留守相公见过池上泛舟举酒话及翰林旧事因成四韵以献之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"引櫂寻池岸，移尊就菊丛。\n何言济川後，相访钓船中。\n白首故情在，青云往事空。\n同时六学士，五相一渔翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24616.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24616","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}